@fact kael.north
# en: A transfer from the frozen North who arrived mid-term with frost in his eyelashes.
text [c365b9] = 来自冰封北境的转学生，学期中途抵达，睫毛上挂着霜。

@fact kael.cold_hands
# en: His hands are always cold. Nobody has ever been warm enough before.
text [4b3405] = 他的手总是冰凉。以前从没有人暖到足以让它们回温。
# en: Notice his hands.
hint [06c4ef] = 留意他的手。

@fact kael.sky
# en: He watches a patch of sky with no stars in it: a star that eats light.
text [1206d5] = 他凝望着一片没有星星的夜空：一颗吞噬光的星。
# en: Find him on the roof at night.
hint [b229e7] = 夜里去屋顶找他。

@fact kael.family
# en: His family serve something under the lake. They sent him to open its door; he came to stop them.
text [cfe636] = 他的家族侍奉着湖底的某样东西。他们派他来打开那扇门；他来，是为了阻止他们。
# en: Earn his trust, and ask what he's running from.
hint [568929] = 赢得他的信任，问他在逃避什么。

@fact kael.sister
# en: He has a younger sister, Ilse, raised to do what he wouldn't.
text [8def5c] = 他有一个妹妹，伊尔泽，被培养去做他不肯做的事。
# en: He has family he doesn't mention.
hint [e8a9f9] = 他有个从不提起的家人。

@fact kael.mother
# en: His mother never once said she was proud of him.
text [a4117c] = 他的母亲从没说过一次为他骄傲。
# en: Under the northern lights, he might talk.
hint [b87b11] = 在北极光下，他也许会开口。

@fact kael.wanting
# en: He was taught not to want things, because wanting is how they control you.
text [34ad8d] = 他被教导不要想要任何东西，因为想要，就是他们控制你的方式。
# en: Some things he was taught not to say.
hint [0c7802] = 有些话，他被教导过不能说。

@fact kael.thaw
# en: In the North nobody says goodbye; it's unlucky. You say "until the thaw" and touch foreheads, so the cold knows you're coming back.
text [1300cb] = 在北境没人说再见，那不吉利。要说“等到解冻”，再碰一下额头，好让寒冷知道你会回来。
# en: Ask how the North says goodbye.
hint [0d1e0f] = 问问北境的人怎么道别。
